WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:35.990
<b>The beloved owner of the local 
restaurant will be sorely missed by everyone.</b>

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:41.080
<b>That is why this episode of Gintama 
will be a solemn and dignified affair.</b>

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:50.170
<b>Closed during this period of mourning.
- Restaurant Owner</b>

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.170
Our condolences.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.920
I'm so glad everyone from Odd 
Jobs came to see him off.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.250
Don't say that.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.620
We owe him too much to skip his funeral.

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:01.030
You're too kind...

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:06.960
No, your husband would still feed 
us when we were completely broke.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.940
I loved his sukonbu on rice.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:10.730
It's so sad...

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.940
I'll never get to try his 
Uji Kintoki on rice again.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.690
Stop it. This isn't like you.

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.450
You all know that he hated 
it when people were gloomy.

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:24.540
We should send him off with a smile, 
in honor of his fun-loving ways.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.510
I'm sure that's what he would want.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.370
You're right...

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:29.900
Sorry about that.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:34.460
<b>When You Go to a Funeral for the First Time,
You're Surprised By How Happy the People Are</b>

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:37.630
A lot of people came.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.610
Yeah.

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:40.850
Just goes to show how 
good of a person he was.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:46.110
There aren't many restaurants that 
serve food tailored to each customer.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.830
He didn't make much money,

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.510
but it earned him something 
that money could never buy...

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:51.870
Owner!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.980
Why? Why did you have to die so soon?

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.280
Why?!

00:02:58.590 --> 00:02:59.820
Toshi, calm down.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:00.930
His spirit is watching us.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:03.980
Owner, your body may have perished,

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:07.660
but the taste of your Hijikata 
Special will never die!

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.090
I see some familiar faces...

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.750
Right...

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.710
He also used to come here.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.210
Uh, Gin-san?

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:22.430
Please don't start a fight here.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.390
A tragic loss...

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.650
Yeah, another one of Edo's 
treasures has been lost.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.780
What?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.150
Why are they behaving themselves today?

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.280
They must be really hurting.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.550
The owner was one of the few people

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.620
who was able to understand 
their bizarre sense of taste.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:51.050
We should be respectful of their wishes.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:04:02.510
Namo Amita Buddha Namo Amita Buddha

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:06.900
Nammy Amita Buddha

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:10.520
Jam Amita Buddha Sam Amita Buddha...

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.930
The monk is kind of fooling around.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.410
I hope he doesn't get hit by lightning.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:23.670
Nemo Amigo Budapest

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:29.830
NAFTA Amsterdam Budweiser...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.760
Ow! What are you doing, Gin-san?!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:37.290
Hey, look!

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.100
Over there! Look!

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.410
What do you mean?

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:42.280
No, over there!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.580
Look at that!

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.900
Could you pipe down?

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.190
Don't make a scene!

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:48.380
No, no, no! Look at that!

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.470
Just look!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.660
This is embarrassing.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.050
Let's pretend we don't know him.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.680
What is he doing?

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:55.420
Uh, wait...

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:56.980
Hey! Stop it, Toshi!

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:57.980
What are you talking about?

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.870
No, no, no! Over there!

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:00.980
Just look over there!

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:04.370
Aren't you a little old to be 
getting excited about a funeral?

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:08.090
Don't worry. We'll be holding 
a funeral for you very soon.

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:09.030
No, no, no! Look!

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:09.970
Just look at that!

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:10.810
Look!

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.240
Can you see it?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.740
Wh-What is that?

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:23.200
Are we the only ones who can 
see it? Is that what this is?

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.060
Nah, I don't think it's 
what you think it is.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:28.010
It's probably no big 
deal. We should be okay.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.690
I-It's not okay.

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:30.790
It is what I think it is.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:33.670
I mean, i-it's the owner!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:35.150
Don't be stupid!

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.290
The owner is dead!

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.710
This is his funeral!

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:40.020
Besides, he was never this transparent!

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:42.300
He had a real distinct presence!

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.380
This is someone else!

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:44.610
That's true.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.380
He certainly had a presence! 
A distinct presence!

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.760
He wasn't transparent!

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:51.530
Uh, doesn't the whole transparent 
thing seem wrong to you?

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.540
Even if he isn't the owner, something's 
wrong when he's transparent.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.270
Then it must be the owner.

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:00.720
You know how he couldn't hide 
what he was thinking sometimes?

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:02.040
He was so transparent.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.510
Yeah, that's true.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.880
He was.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.050
He could be transparent at times.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.050
Wait, but something's 
wrong if it is the owner.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.530
Why would the dead owner be 
sitting up there all transparent?

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:14.700
Something's wrong...

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:17.730
Well, that must mean he's a ghost.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.600
Oh, I see now.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:20.450
It's a ghost.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.190
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.320
I-I need to go to the restroom!

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.450
My legs are numb from kneeling so long!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.570
Let me go! What are you doing?!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:34.250
Hey!

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:35.550
The owner's looking at us!

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:36.610
He's staring right at us!

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:37.460
Oh, damn!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:38.210
Don't look at him!

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.580
Pretend we can't see him!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.840
Hey! He's coming for us!

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.460
The owner's coming for 
us! What do we do?!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.270
Play dead! Play dead!

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:47.530
Play dead?! He's the one who's dead!

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.190
He's actually dead!

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:50.600
Hey, Tatsukichi!

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:51.720
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.470
What? The monk's gonna 
be at this forever!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.270
Stupid! Put that way!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.080
It's disrespectful!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.220
I don't care!

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:03.310
He should be grateful I even 
came to this boring funeral!

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:06.690
Tatsukichi?!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.780
What happened to you, Tatsukichi?!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:12.360
I'm sorry. It appears that 
my son has gotten sick.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:14.200
We'll have to excuse ourselves.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:25.730
Toshi, weren't you 
going to the restroom?

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:27.700
N-No, I'm good now.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.050
You're good now?

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.720
But you're both shaking.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.330
It's not healthy to hold it in.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:33.970
N-No, we're good.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:36.960
H-He's monitoring us.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:42.650
The owner returned from hell to make sure 
that his funeral goes off without a hitch.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.060
This is bad.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.440
If anything goes wrong 
with this funeral...

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:49.490
The owner will curse us to death!

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:53.550
Just like that monk who was reading 
weird sutras while falling asleep...

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:56.490
Who knows what he'll do to us?!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.640
This isn't funny!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:02.180
I came here to say goodbye 
to the nice owner!

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:05.250
I'm not here to see 
that hard-boiled guy!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.990
Excuse me. It's your 
turn to burn incense.

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:08.610
Huh?!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.010
It's your turn to burn incense.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.680
The relatives have all taken their turn,

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:14.260
so you're the only ones left.

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:18.300
Hey, it's already our 
turn to burn incense.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:19.260
What do we do?

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:20.760
Don't be absurd.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.500
I'm already about to piss my pants.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:25.130
I'm not about to try aroma 
therapy right next to him!

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:27.490
I'll have other aromas coming out of my ass!

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.400
And wait, how does burning incense work?

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:32.380
I know you walk up there and sprinkle 
something, but my memory's all hazy.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:34.610
Are you an idiot?! 
Aren't you a grown-up?!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.340
You sprinkle it three times on your 
forehead and do that, then that, and that!

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:39.120
All you're saying is 
to do that and that!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.280
Your memory's just as hazy as mine!

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:43.290
Once I'm up there, I'll remember 
what to do! I'm not like you!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.010
You go first then!

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:46.600
Hell no! You go!

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.110
I'll go first then.

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.550
Watch me, Kagura-chan.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:50.590
Wait, Shinpachi!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.510
Let's not be hasty!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.720
Huh? Hasty?

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.650
Kagura-chan doesn't know how this 
works, so I'm going to show her.

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:56.430
Can you do it?!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.590
Don't screw it up!

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:58.720
Come back alive!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:08:59.510
Promise me!

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:00.970
Are you making fun of me?

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:01.800
Whatever.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:02.930
Watch me, Kagura-chan.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:07.560
<b>1) Bow to the relatives and monk.</b>

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:07.560
First, you go to where the incense 
is and bow to the relatives and monk.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:11.070
<b>2) Pay your respects to the portrait.</b>

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:11.070
Then you kneel down before the incense 
and pay your respects to the portrait.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:14.340
Hold the beads in your left hand and use 
your right hand to take a pinch of incense

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.320
<b>3) Hold the beads in your left hand and 
use your right hand to take a pinch of incense</b>

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:18.530
<b>and brush it against your forehead before 
placing the incense in the burner. Do this three times.</b>

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:17.150
and brush it against your forehead 
before placing the incense in the burner.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.530
Do this three times.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:23.080
<b>4) Pay your respects to the portrait 
again and bow to the relatives.</b>

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:23.080
Finally, pay your respects to the 
portrait again and bow to the relatives.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.040
Okay, all done.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.080
Well, isn't it easy?

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.010
Mission complete!

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:30.440
I knew you could pull it off!

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.780
We'll throw a party to celebrate.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:32.860
Put on your best clothes!

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.720
You're starting to piss me off.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.050
What's this about? Are you 
trying to belittle me?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.020
You still have much to 
learn, in my opinion,

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.510
but you look like a man now.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.590
Why are you making such a 
fuss about burning incense?!

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:45.600
Did you people really 
think I couldn't do it?!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:49.230
Look, the owner seems happier now.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:52.610
I think we're gonna survive this ordeal.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:55.300
Okay, I'll go next.

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:57.360
Kagura, do exactly what Shinpachi did!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.420
Don't screw up!

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:59.230
I got this!

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:01.240
I remember everything perfectly!

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.740
Um, first is...

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:08.500
<b>1) Bow to the relatives and monk.</b>

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.560
Make the monk bow.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.500
You're already completely off!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:17.090
<b>2) Pay your respects to the portrait.</b>

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.260
Respect, yo!

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:13.070
Everyone with me!

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:14.160
Yo...

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.760
That's not what it means!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.090
You don't have to listen to her, monk!

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.510
<b>3) Hold the beads in your left hand and use 
your right hand to take a pinch of incense and brush</b>

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.640
Monk!

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:19.640
<b>it against your forehead before placing 
the incense in the burner. Do this three times.</b>

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:24.640
<b>4) Pay your respects to the portrait 
again and bow to the relatives.</b>

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.890
Respect, yo!

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.500
Yo...

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:24.640
Monk!

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:26.970
Is that good enough?

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:29.200
Were you even watching Shinpachi?!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.960
Who told you to turn the 
monk's head into a pulp?!

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.320
My legs were numb from 
kneeling so long...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:35.480
What do your legs have 
to do with anything?!

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:36.950
Your head is what's numb!

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:39.150
Damn, the owner's getting mad.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.030
We need to fix this funeral!

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.740
Add another step to the flowchart!

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.540
<b>1) Bow to the relatives and monk.</b>

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.480
After we bow to the relatives and monk,

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:46.040
we resurrect the monk!

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.000
<b>2) Resurrect the monk.</b>

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.160
Then we burn incense!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.160
<b>3) Kneel before the incense and 
pay your respects to the portrait.</b>

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.330
I'll go next then.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.920
Sogo! Are you sure about this?!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.530
Can you do this?!

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:52.300
Can you manage it?!

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.290
Can I trust you?!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.670
It'll be just fine.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:11:00.800
<b>1) Bow to the relatives and monk.</b>

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.470
I just have to follow 
your flowchart, right?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.150
Bow to the relatives monkey hair.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.890
<b>1) Bow to the relatives and monkey.</b>

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.890
You already screwed up!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.970
Don't screw with the flowchart!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.550
We're getting nowhere!

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:08.510
Forget it!

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.310
Forget the incense! Just 
resurrect the monk!

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:13.010
What the hell?!

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:15.900
Nobody told you to resurrect his hair!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.290
Nothing's changed!

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.380
We just have a dead 
body with a wig on it!

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.320
No.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:23.670
He looks happier now.

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:25.410
Isn't that nice, monk.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.330
Who gives a damn?!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.130
Hey! The owner's completely 
pissed off now!

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:31.330
He's gone SSJ!

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.140
Prioritize the rescue of the monk!

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:35.800
First, we resurrect the monk!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.790
<b>1) Resurrect the monk.</b>

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.920
<b>2) Bow to the relatives and monk.</b>

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.920
Then we bow to the relatives and monk!

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:39.520
Wait!

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:40.830
There's another dead body!

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:41.510
It's one of the relatives!

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.550
Why would he die from losing his wig?!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:44.950
How weak is he?!

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.560
And why is everyone ignoring him?!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.320
Are they trying to pretend that they 
didn't notice he was wearing a wig?!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.680
Are they trying to be nice?!

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.310
That settles it.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:54.650
<b>1) Resurrect the monk and relative.</b>

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:54.650
We'll have to start by resurrecting 
the monk and relative.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:57.730
<b>2) Bow and apologize to 
the relatives and monk.</b>

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:57.730
Then we bow and apologize 
to the relatives and monk.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.600
Or else the owner's 
funeral will be a wreck.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:04.880
I'll take responsibility 
